操作反复失败。\n- **排除其他可能**：Pod 处于 Pending 状态且未触发重启（RestartCount=0），证明资源调度与主机环境正常，故障严格隔离在镜像拉取阶段。\n\n现有 K8s 状态、事件与指标证据充分，无需补充其他维度即可确立根因。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 59.2s\n├─ 问题定位: 16.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 32.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp: 32.3s (Evidence 26.0s, RCA 6.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 59.235, "metrics": {"run_id": "8153576debc04ac2", "mttr": {"value": "59.2s", "seconds": 59.241573333740234, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error, pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {